WEBVTT

00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:09.974
Dammit! I blew it!

00:00:17.324 --> 00:00:19.864
You're sure she'll be okay?

00:00:19.864 --> 00:00:23.454
Despite appearances, she graduated at
the top of her class in the academy.

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:25.724
She'll do fine.

00:00:26.034 --> 00:00:27.764
Please commence operations.

00:00:27.964 --> 00:00:29.194
Roger.

00:00:29.934 --> 00:00:33.044
Okay, to release their limiters...

00:00:33.044 --> 00:00:36.994
Up, up, down, right, left, left, down,
right, further in, left, up, up, down, right...

00:00:38.214 --> 00:00:40.314
You're sure she's going to be okay?

00:00:40.314 --> 00:00:42.144
Despite appearances, she graduated at...

00:00:42.354 --> 00:00:45.844
S-S-Special espers The H-H-H!

00:00:46.954 --> 00:00:49.194
I need to do it with more spirit.

00:00:49.194 --> 00:00:52.884
Special espers THE HOUND! R-R-Released!

00:00:56.234 --> 00:00:59.304
No prob. I can handle this.

00:00:59.304 --> 00:01:02.064
I'll get you all to safety.

00:01:02.064 --> 00:01:05.064
But for now, this is the best I can do!

00:01:05.604 --> 00:01:06.804
Target sighted!

00:01:07.544 --> 00:01:11.064
Along with the limited-edition
Moga-chan dolls he stole!

00:01:11.314 --> 00:01:12.934
Please begin the mission.

00:01:13.214 --> 00:01:14.644
Roger!

00:01:14.784 --> 00:01:16.144
Have to play it smart and run...

00:01:17.654 --> 00:01:19.244
A mouse? Akira Yadorigi?!

00:01:19.624 --> 00:01:21.144
Target is now on the move.

00:01:21.454 --> 00:01:23.444
Hatsune, he's headed your way.

00:01:24.724 --> 00:01:25.894
Hatsune?

00:01:25.894 --> 00:01:28.194
I can smell him coming without you telling me.

00:01:28.594 --> 00:01:29.894
Hatsune knows.

00:01:31.394 --> 00:01:32.624
Metamorphosis!

00:01:35.734 --> 00:01:38.564
Ow! Let go! Let go!

00:01:40.274 --> 00:01:42.034
WOLF!

00:01:44.574 --> 00:01:46.204
Hatsune Inugami, huh?!

00:01:51.614 --> 00:01:52.954
Food!

00:01:53.784 --> 00:01:55.084
H-Hatsune!

00:02:01.864 --> 00:02:03.914
Hatsune!

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:06.804
Ow...

00:02:10.674 --> 00:02:12.664
My food!

00:02:13.004 --> 00:02:14.494
My necklace is gone.

00:02:14.604 --> 00:02:16.874
It's gone! Gone! Gone!
What are you doing, Hatsune?! Get after him!

00:02:16.874 --> 00:02:20.674
Hatsune, I'll look for the necklace!

00:02:22.044 --> 00:02:23.814
It's here. Hatsune, it's here!

00:02:24.254 --> 00:02:25.684
Don't you dare...

00:02:25.784 --> 00:02:30.154
DON'T YOU DARE TOUCH THAT!

00:02:38.494 --> 00:02:45.594
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:46.604 --> 00:02:52.474
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:54.914 --> 00:03:00.714
Meeting you like I did

00:03:01.054 --> 00:03:05.924
Wasn't just so we could live

00:03:07.194 --> 00:03:12.724
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:03:13.134 --> 00:03:17.734
And surely change the future

00:03:18.334 --> 00:03:21.244
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:03:21.244 --> 00:03:24.374
Is released (changing yourself)

00:03:24.514 --> 00:03:30.244
An angel's shining surges through me

00:03:31.684 --> 00:03:34.254
The "wings" that will save the world

00:03:34.254 --> 00:03:37.084
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:03:37.324 --> 00:03:43.494
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:03:43.634 --> 00:03:46.434
The power given to me

00:03:46.434 --> 00:03:49.064
Spurs me into the sky

00:03:49.064 --> 00:03:54.804
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:03:55.144 --> 00:04:00.674
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:04:08.524 --> 00:04:09.924
I'm... home?

00:04:11.194 --> 00:04:13.424
I don't recognize those shoes.

00:04:13.424 --> 00:04:14.914
We have a guest at this hour?

00:04:16.234 --> 00:04:17.334
Oh! Welcome home!

00:04:17.334 --> 00:04:18.594
What are you doing?

00:04:18.694 --> 00:04:19.834
Um... Nothing.

00:04:19.834 --> 00:04:21.564
R-Right! Nothing!

00:04:21.564 --> 00:04:23.404
The power's out.

00:04:23.404 --> 00:04:24.394
I'll have a look.

00:04:24.704 --> 00:04:25.794
S-Stay out!

00:04:26.974 --> 00:04:28.104
No, it's just...

00:04:30.814 --> 00:04:31.644
Kaoru?

00:04:33.084 --> 00:04:35.314
Is something wrong with your voice?

00:04:36.184 --> 00:04:37.154
A cold, maybe?

00:04:37.954 --> 00:04:40.884
And is this an ear? It's like a cat's ear.

00:04:41.584 --> 00:04:44.254
Meow! I've got cat ears on for fun!

00:04:45.194 --> 00:04:47.164
Kaoru loves them!

00:04:47.964 --> 00:04:50.634
My, what a long nose you have.

00:04:50.634 --> 00:04:52.154
Um, well...

00:04:52.534 --> 00:04:56.464
You can't ad lib at all.
You should say you're playing Tengu.

00:04:57.404 --> 00:05:00.574
What's this? My, what a beastly
mouth and fangs you have.

00:05:00.574 --> 00:05:03.514
Agh! We can't keep up with this!

00:05:03.514 --> 00:05:06.964
The better to eat you with!

00:05:10.254 --> 00:05:11.784
Hatsune! Stop!

00:05:11.784 --> 00:05:12.804
STOP!

00:05:13.654 --> 00:05:15.314
H-Hatsune?

00:05:16.324 --> 00:05:20.094
I see. She thought I came to bring her back.

00:05:20.094 --> 00:05:21.464
So it seems.

00:05:21.464 --> 00:05:22.934
Which means...

00:05:22.934 --> 00:05:24.034
Hatsune...

00:05:24.034 --> 00:05:25.654
says she ran away from home.

00:05:25.734 --> 00:05:26.834
I see...

00:05:26.834 --> 00:05:29.354
SHE'S RUN AWAY?!

00:05:29.974 --> 00:05:32.024
35th sense: "Letting Your Feelings Hang Out!
Hatsune Runs Away"

00:05:33.074 --> 00:05:35.274
Hatsune has quit The Hound.

00:05:35.274 --> 00:05:36.714
Quit?

00:05:36.714 --> 00:05:38.504
Today, she joins The Children.

00:05:40.014 --> 00:05:41.944
Hatsune is never going back!

00:05:42.884 --> 00:05:44.054
Can we keep her?

00:05:44.054 --> 00:05:46.284
She's well-behaved and very obedient!

00:05:46.284 --> 00:05:48.024
We'll take care of her!

00:05:48.024 --> 00:05:49.024
Boss! Woof!

00:05:49.024 --> 00:05:50.754
She's a human being!

00:05:50.994 --> 00:05:53.794
Lady Hatsune has run away?!

00:05:53.794 --> 00:05:56.824
What's the meaning of this?!
Did you screw something up?!

00:05:56.964 --> 00:05:59.294
Akira! Bring her back at once!

00:05:59.404 --> 00:06:01.364
Um... Who's?

00:06:02.134 --> 00:06:04.534
My dad, who lives in Touhoku.

00:06:04.904 --> 00:06:07.544
I see. So, your family is...

00:06:07.544 --> 00:06:08.874
My dad can also swap minds with animals.

00:06:08.874 --> 00:06:11.244
DAD
My dad can also swap minds with animals.

00:06:11.244 --> 00:06:11.814
DAD

00:06:11.814 --> 00:06:14.484
DAD
And use their vocal cords to speak.

00:06:14.484 --> 00:06:15.944
DAD

00:06:16.884 --> 00:06:20.354
Dad, I keep telling you! If you want
to say something, use the phone!

00:06:20.354 --> 00:06:24.584
No fair covering the hawk's eyes to calm it down!

00:06:25.194 --> 00:06:26.824
Come on, girl!

00:06:26.824 --> 00:06:27.724
Woof! Woof!

00:06:28.394 --> 00:06:30.894
No! Hatsune won't go back!

00:06:30.894 --> 00:06:32.734
Be a good girl, Hatsune!

00:06:32.734 --> 00:06:33.734
No!

00:06:33.734 --> 00:06:35.104
Hatsune!

00:06:35.104 --> 00:06:36.734
Hatsune has run away!

00:06:36.734 --> 00:06:38.674
Stop being unreasonable!

00:06:38.974 --> 00:06:42.304
Hatsune is not being unreasonable!
I hate that woman!

00:06:43.774 --> 00:06:48.404
Has she not been getting along
with their new supervisor?

00:06:49.814 --> 00:06:50.984
Why?

00:06:50.984 --> 00:06:53.354
We're not entirely sure.

00:06:54.954 --> 00:06:56.514
It's a scramble request for The Children!

00:07:00.764 --> 00:07:02.924
Is this really going to earn us spending money?

00:07:03.164 --> 00:07:04.524
Just watch.

00:07:04.934 --> 00:07:09.764
Why do you think I stole so many
limited-edition Moga-chans?

00:07:10.134 --> 00:07:12.464
Because it's your hobby, obviously.

00:07:13.774 --> 00:07:15.604
It's not a hobby!

00:07:16.644 --> 00:07:17.874
It's a way of life.

00:07:17.874 --> 00:07:19.004
A passion!

00:07:20.984 --> 00:07:24.554
Having all these limited-edition
Moga-chans has caused a shortage!

00:07:24.554 --> 00:07:27.014
That drives up their price on
the online auction sites!

00:07:27.454 --> 00:07:31.014
And how does auctioning them at
a high price get us money?

00:07:32.154 --> 00:07:34.354
You're an idiot, as usual.

00:07:34.764 --> 00:07:36.054
Who's stupid?!

00:07:39.164 --> 00:07:41.164
You don't have to point at me, too!

00:07:41.164 --> 00:07:43.004
Agh! You guys!

00:07:43.004 --> 00:07:44.304
You guys...

00:07:44.304 --> 00:07:45.804
Why are you here?!

00:07:45.804 --> 00:07:49.574
Because you listed a bunch of stolen
merchandise on a regular online auction.

00:07:49.574 --> 00:07:51.704
You thought we couldn't track you down?!

00:07:52.884 --> 00:07:55.544
By the way, what exactly is an online auction?

00:07:55.544 --> 00:07:57.774
Even a flying squirrel knows that...

00:07:58.254 --> 00:08:01.224
The Children, released!

00:08:02.224 --> 00:08:02.884
<<RELEASED>>

00:08:03.424 --> 00:08:04.984
Best at fighting! The red star!

00:08:05.554 --> 00:08:07.084
The fastest speed! The blue wind!

00:08:07.824 --> 00:08:09.594
The most nimble! The purple flower!

00:08:10.064 --> 00:08:12.054
The biggest mouthful! Yummy food!

00:08:12.564 --> 00:08:13.864
It's even longer now.

00:08:13.864 --> 00:08:15.964
Must be special because they
have an extra one today.

00:08:15.964 --> 00:08:17.434
Sorry! Give us a sec.

00:08:17.434 --> 00:08:18.534
Get on with it!

00:08:18.904 --> 00:08:22.204
The Absolutely Lovely Children, plus...

00:08:22.204 --> 00:08:23.264
Woof!

00:08:24.744 --> 00:08:26.514
Why don't we run while they're doing that?

00:08:26.514 --> 00:08:28.614
It's how things are.

00:08:28.614 --> 00:08:29.514
Really?

00:08:29.514 --> 00:08:31.254
Anyway, take care of this! I'm outta here!

00:08:31.254 --> 00:08:32.084
Hey!
Anyway, take care of this! I'm outta here!

00:08:32.284 --> 00:08:33.584
Hatsune! After him!

00:08:33.584 --> 00:08:34.814
Leave it to me, Boss!

00:08:35.154 --> 00:08:36.414
Metamorphosis!

00:08:40.594 --> 00:08:42.754
Damn! The very picture of!

00:08:46.164 --> 00:08:47.394
Hatsune.

00:08:51.804 --> 00:08:53.324
What'd you come here for?

00:08:53.474 --> 00:08:56.004
Because I'm The Hound's supervisor!

00:08:56.004 --> 00:08:59.344
I can't just stand by while you're on a mission!

00:08:59.344 --> 00:09:01.244
Hatsune has quit The Hound!

00:09:01.244 --> 00:09:03.544
What? You can't mean that.

00:09:04.254 --> 00:09:05.784
God, you're dumb.

00:09:05.784 --> 00:09:08.124
Put some more tsundere into the way you say it!

00:09:08.124 --> 00:09:11.024
I... I didn't come to save you, okay? Like that?

00:09:11.024 --> 00:09:11.894
Exactly!

00:09:11.894 --> 00:09:13.954
Hey, watch what you're grabbing!

00:09:15.424 --> 00:09:18.864
They got away... It's your fault!

00:09:18.864 --> 00:09:20.334
You can't mean that!

00:09:20.334 --> 00:09:22.094
I'll tear you apart!

00:09:22.564 --> 00:09:23.904
Hatsune! No!

00:09:26.134 --> 00:09:27.534
Boss...

00:09:27.904 --> 00:09:29.674
Y-You're The Hound's?

00:09:30.444 --> 00:09:33.004
Yes. Master Sergeant Keiko Kojika.

00:09:33.184 --> 00:09:35.414
I'll bite you! I swear, I'll bite you!

00:09:35.414 --> 00:09:38.214
Why do you hate me so much?

00:09:38.214 --> 00:09:40.944
If we spoke, person to person,
could we reach an understanding?

00:09:41.284 --> 00:09:43.594
I hate everything about you!
Stay away from me!

00:09:43.594 --> 00:09:45.584
I'll stop everything you do!

00:09:46.964 --> 00:09:48.794
Oh... Total rejection!

00:09:48.794 --> 00:09:51.554
She totally rejects my very existence?!

00:09:51.934 --> 00:09:53.124
Hatsune!

00:09:54.564 --> 00:09:58.174
You idiot! Look how much trouble you've
caused everyone! Apologize!

00:09:58.174 --> 00:09:59.944
No! I absolutely won't!

00:09:59.944 --> 00:10:01.444
What don't you like about her?

00:10:01.444 --> 00:10:02.404
Everything!

00:10:02.404 --> 00:10:04.444
That doesn't tell us anything!

00:10:04.444 --> 00:10:05.934
Sorry, Supervisor Kojika.

00:10:07.044 --> 00:10:09.884
No, it's okay. It must be my fault.

00:10:09.884 --> 00:10:11.354
That's not true!

00:10:11.354 --> 00:10:14.254
It's not your fault! You're working hard at this!

00:10:14.624 --> 00:10:15.924
Oh?

00:10:15.924 --> 00:10:18.224
You're wonderful! Please don't quit!

00:10:27.664 --> 00:10:29.974
You carry that thing around with you?!

00:10:29.974 --> 00:10:33.404
Blowguns aren't against the law
and good for dieting, too.

00:10:33.974 --> 00:10:34.874
Are you okay?

00:10:35.344 --> 00:10:38.944
I was so scared!

00:10:38.944 --> 00:10:40.644
Hey! Akira!

00:10:41.044 --> 00:10:43.084
Any way you look at it, that's the cause, right?

00:10:43.084 --> 00:10:43.954
Yeah.

00:10:43.954 --> 00:10:45.854
Poor Hatsune.

00:10:45.854 --> 00:10:46.514
Huh?

00:10:50.524 --> 00:10:51.994
What? Tell me.

00:10:51.994 --> 00:10:52.544
Idiot!

00:10:53.894 --> 00:10:55.864
Typical male.

00:10:55.864 --> 00:10:58.964
You don't think of me like that, right?

00:10:58.964 --> 00:11:00.394
No self-awareness...

00:11:05.574 --> 00:11:07.694
The condors in the yard are sinking!

00:11:10.144 --> 00:11:12.834
Lu, lu, lu! I'm not a fox!

00:11:13.444 --> 00:11:15.934
Oh, I get it! She's jealous!

00:11:16.614 --> 00:11:18.084
Sorry.

00:11:18.084 --> 00:11:20.114
No, it's my fault.

00:11:21.054 --> 00:11:24.214
I had nobody to rely on when I came to BABEL,

00:11:24.324 --> 00:11:26.754
so Akira's been helping me out a lot.

00:11:26.994 --> 00:11:31.264
No, it's mine, too. I wanted her
to get up to speed here quickly,

00:11:31.264 --> 00:11:33.804
so I set aside Hatsune's feelings.

00:11:33.804 --> 00:11:36.374
We need to give you a male supervisor, then.

00:11:36.374 --> 00:11:37.864
No! You don't!

00:11:38.304 --> 00:11:41.134
But I want to try and make this assignment work!

00:11:41.504 --> 00:11:43.334
I've loved animals since I was little,

00:11:43.414 --> 00:11:45.414
and I own the complete anime DVD sets

00:11:45.414 --> 00:11:48.144
of "Tascal the Raccoon" and
"The Dog of Flinders".

00:11:48.144 --> 00:11:50.704
Did she get this job just
because she likes anime?

00:11:51.084 --> 00:11:57.124
Jealousy's bad enough in humans,
but Hatsune's practically an animal.

00:11:57.124 --> 00:12:00.964
And she sees Akira, her "owner", as
replacing her with this new woman.

00:12:00.964 --> 00:12:04.964
Anyway, now that we know the cause,
we have to try and help them out.

00:12:04.964 --> 00:12:05.554
Help?

00:12:05.894 --> 00:12:09.694
The problem is Ms. Kojika isn't used
to being the leader of The Hound.

00:12:10.004 --> 00:12:12.734
She needs to develop strong
leadership and presence.

00:12:13.174 --> 00:12:15.474
Leadership and presence?

00:12:15.574 --> 00:12:16.844
Like this?

00:12:16.844 --> 00:12:18.514
Yet another reference...

00:12:18.514 --> 00:12:19.704
Then go!

00:12:21.744 --> 00:12:23.344
BABEL 2, launching!

00:12:25.484 --> 00:12:27.044
Whoa! Fast forward!

00:12:30.824 --> 00:12:35.854
I call this Operation Extreme Situation!
Increase Trust Via Survival!

00:12:36.064 --> 00:12:38.754
Operation Extreme Situation!
Increase Trust Via Survival!

00:12:42.934 --> 00:12:44.734
Out of the blue?

00:12:45.104 --> 00:12:47.174
Any complaints?

00:12:47.174 --> 00:12:47.834
No.

00:12:48.704 --> 00:12:50.144
Meat...

00:12:51.414 --> 00:12:54.104
Akira! Akira, what's wrong?!

00:12:56.344 --> 00:12:58.144
You're awake, Hatsune?

00:13:01.284 --> 00:13:03.444
Hatsune, listen to me.

00:13:04.094 --> 00:13:05.854
Akira's in a dangerous condition.

00:13:06.254 --> 00:13:06.814
Dangerous?

00:13:07.294 --> 00:13:11.324
Yes. He has to be brought to the
rescue boat within two hours.

00:13:11.994 --> 00:13:14.964
And the rescue ship's 100
kilometers away from here!

00:13:14.964 --> 00:13:15.994
100 kilometers?

00:13:16.474 --> 00:13:18.934
But if we don't, Akira may die.

00:13:23.714 --> 00:13:27.014
Are you sure about this?

00:13:27.014 --> 00:13:30.644
Akira, you've replaced such a cute animal!

00:13:31.554 --> 00:13:32.444
It's too much!

00:13:32.514 --> 00:13:34.884
Let me take a picture with you! Please! Please!

00:13:34.884 --> 00:13:36.254
Oboro, you, too?

00:13:36.254 --> 00:13:39.154
No, but is it wrong that I'm still
a little girl at heart?

00:13:39.154 --> 00:13:40.524
Akira.

00:13:40.724 --> 00:13:42.694
Hatsune acknowledges Kaoru as her boss.

00:13:43.964 --> 00:13:45.264
True.

00:13:45.334 --> 00:13:48.924
Hatsune may submit to someone she
recognizes as her superior.

00:13:52.734 --> 00:13:56.034
This is Red Riding Hood.
Leading Wolf, as planned.

00:13:56.774 --> 00:13:58.974
Ms. Kashiwagi, do you read me?

00:13:58.974 --> 00:14:02.784
This is Hunter. We're tracking
you 15 klicks to the rear.

00:14:02.784 --> 00:14:04.514
Please continue the operation.

00:14:04.514 --> 00:14:05.314
Roger.

00:14:06.724 --> 00:14:08.184
Hang in there, Hatsune!

00:14:10.824 --> 00:14:11.914
Hatsune...

00:14:22.634 --> 00:14:24.364
Looks like the blizzard's let up.

00:14:26.744 --> 00:14:29.204
Oh. Time for my regular report.

00:14:29.204 --> 00:14:30.804
Red Riding Hood here.

00:14:31.174 --> 00:14:33.144
Proceeding well with Wolf.

00:14:34.344 --> 00:14:36.684
It's almost time for Hatsune to eat.

00:14:36.684 --> 00:14:38.444
...is what Akira just said.

00:14:39.554 --> 00:14:40.414
Ms. Oboro?

00:14:41.084 --> 00:14:42.574
This is Grandma. Red Riding Hood...

00:14:43.124 --> 00:14:43.554
What?

00:14:45.324 --> 00:14:46.254
Communications!

00:14:46.254 --> 00:14:48.354
We've lost comms on the ship, as well!

00:14:48.694 --> 00:14:50.784
All electrical systems are down!

00:14:51.394 --> 00:14:52.164
A breakdown?

00:14:52.564 --> 00:14:54.464
It went dead.

00:14:55.304 --> 00:14:57.424
Let's rest and have something to eat.

00:14:57.974 --> 00:14:58.964
Food!

00:15:00.444 --> 00:15:04.874
Hatsune... Hatsune, who usually
just bares her fangs at me!

00:15:05.014 --> 00:15:06.744
With that expression!

00:15:09.614 --> 00:15:14.014
We have plenty of BABEL emergency
rations, so eat whatever you like!

00:15:15.324 --> 00:15:17.844
Now, then... Huh?

00:15:19.294 --> 00:15:20.754
Food! Food!

00:15:21.864 --> 00:15:23.354
Food! Food!

00:15:25.234 --> 00:15:28.134
Um, Hatsune? Listen...

00:15:31.304 --> 00:15:33.844
You forgot the can opener?!

00:15:33.844 --> 00:15:35.504
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:15:36.914 --> 00:15:37.674
Open! Come on, open!

00:15:37.674 --> 00:15:40.274
There's no point freezing what's inside of them!
Open! Come on, open!

00:15:40.344 --> 00:15:42.044
What should we do?

00:15:42.044 --> 00:15:44.444
Look for a convenience store?
Except there aren't any here...

00:15:45.054 --> 00:15:45.644
Akira...

00:15:46.114 --> 00:15:49.174
I need my strength to save Akira!

00:15:49.654 --> 00:15:52.984
Meat! I need to eat meat!

00:15:59.934 --> 00:16:02.994
What's with that look?!
I'm scared! I'm really scared!

00:16:05.574 --> 00:16:06.764
Meat...

00:16:07.974 --> 00:16:09.944
This isn't a breakdown.

00:16:10.314 --> 00:16:14.544
The effects of a major solar flare
has caused a magnetic storm.

00:16:15.214 --> 00:16:19.114
Since we've lost communications,
should I return to my body?

00:16:19.114 --> 00:16:21.224
...is what Akira just said.

00:16:21.224 --> 00:16:22.274
No.

00:16:23.294 --> 00:16:26.254
Right now, your body's hypothermic,
in a state of near-death.

00:16:27.894 --> 00:16:30.564
Those two can do this, right?

00:16:30.564 --> 00:16:32.364
...is what Akira just said.

00:16:34.764 --> 00:16:36.424
It'll be okay.

00:16:37.004 --> 00:16:40.024
Hatsune's just scared of new people.

00:16:41.344 --> 00:16:43.574
You tried really hard. That must have hurt.

00:16:45.714 --> 00:16:48.344
I'm fine! I'm strong, okay?

00:16:48.784 --> 00:16:51.274
I know how that feels.

00:16:51.754 --> 00:16:53.584
Because I was afraid of trusting someone.

00:16:55.884 --> 00:16:58.754
I'm sure The Hound will become a good team.

00:17:08.534 --> 00:17:10.004
I got meat!

00:17:12.074 --> 00:17:16.634
Wait! You can't! I never said you
can do such a cruel thing!

00:17:23.214 --> 00:17:24.114
The parent!

00:17:24.114 --> 00:17:25.174
The parent's come!

00:17:34.294 --> 00:17:35.264
Hatsune!

00:17:37.334 --> 00:17:38.624
Hatsune's precious!

00:17:39.134 --> 00:17:40.594
Don't touch that!

00:17:47.304 --> 00:17:49.274
HATSUNE!

00:17:57.884 --> 00:17:58.944
It's cold.

00:17:59.784 --> 00:18:01.484
Losing consciousness!

00:18:02.154 --> 00:18:02.884
Akira...

00:18:06.594 --> 00:18:11.924
You've taken care of Hatsune since we
were little, because Hatsune is a fool.

00:18:13.364 --> 00:18:17.564
Akira is Hatsune's big brother.

00:18:19.074 --> 00:18:21.064
Her mother.

00:18:23.174 --> 00:18:26.444
But, that's why... Always...

00:18:27.814 --> 00:18:30.614
Why Hatsune always fights!

00:18:31.014 --> 00:18:32.344
For Akira!

00:18:40.224 --> 00:18:44.494
For Akira... For Akira... I eat!

00:18:56.344 --> 00:18:58.704
I... can't...

00:18:59.874 --> 00:19:02.504
A... Aki... ra...

00:19:11.624 --> 00:19:14.324
Sorry. Go back to the sea.

00:19:22.834 --> 00:19:25.304
Come back, meat!

00:19:26.104 --> 00:19:27.804
Food... The food...

00:19:28.374 --> 00:19:29.344
Gone.

00:19:31.944 --> 00:19:35.744
You should have stayed out of it!
If I don't eat, Akira will!

00:19:35.984 --> 00:19:37.554
If I hadn't, you would have...

00:19:37.554 --> 00:19:40.574
If Hatsune can't save Akira,
she'd rather be dead!

00:19:45.394 --> 00:19:47.454
Don't be ridiculous!

00:19:48.424 --> 00:19:51.264
All three of us have to reach that rescue ship!

00:20:04.614 --> 00:20:07.174
Um... We should get going...

00:20:07.684 --> 00:20:10.704
Oh, no! Your whole body's suddenly
frozen because you're soaked!

00:20:11.354 --> 00:20:13.554
I have to do something before ice forms on you!

00:20:13.554 --> 00:20:15.884
Convenience store... Convenience store...
Still none here!

00:20:27.104 --> 00:20:28.004
Ms. Kojika!

00:20:28.004 --> 00:20:29.554
Are you okay?

00:20:41.644 --> 00:20:42.414
See?

00:20:43.784 --> 00:20:46.754
Didn't I tell you they'd become a good team?

00:20:46.754 --> 00:20:47.684
Yeah.

00:20:50.294 --> 00:20:51.654
So pretty!

00:20:51.654 --> 00:20:53.924
Cool! An aurora!

00:20:54.524 --> 00:21:00.694
Solar flares don't just cause magnetic
storms. They also produce auroras.

00:21:03.604 --> 00:21:07.434
Magnificent! I wish Kashiwagi had come, too.

00:21:08.944 --> 00:21:11.844
You're finally all mine!

00:21:12.274 --> 00:21:14.684
Check it! Cool! It's beyond cool!

00:21:14.684 --> 00:21:17.284
Auroras are caused by high-energy
particles in the atmosphere...

00:21:17.284 --> 00:21:19.084
Who cares, as long as they're pretty?

00:21:20.254 --> 00:21:22.184
So, that's what happened?

00:21:22.524 --> 00:21:23.994
It was that bad?

00:21:23.994 --> 00:21:24.644
Here!

00:21:27.964 --> 00:21:31.234
"Somehow, I feel left out.
She's taken Hatsune from me."

00:21:31.234 --> 00:21:32.134
Eep!

00:21:32.134 --> 00:21:36.404
She used to just stick to you, Akira.
We understand how you feel.

00:21:36.404 --> 00:21:39.834
Take it like a man and withdraw gracefully.

00:21:39.834 --> 00:21:41.704
Um, I don't get what you're saying.

00:21:42.144 --> 00:21:43.604
Oh, to be young.

00:21:43.714 --> 00:21:45.614
Look familiar, Natsuko?

00:21:45.614 --> 00:21:47.014
What do you mean?

00:21:47.014 --> 00:21:48.384
Oh, nothing.

00:21:48.384 --> 00:21:51.314
Emergency alert! The Hound,
scramble immediately!

00:21:52.254 --> 00:21:56.184
Takashi Kugutsu is about to try selling
those limited-edition Moga-chans again!

00:21:57.894 --> 00:21:58.594
Orders?

00:21:58.594 --> 00:21:59.644
Let's go, Kojika!

00:22:00.054 --> 00:22:00.924
Right!

00:22:01.064 --> 00:22:04.824
Special espers The Hound, released!

00:22:05.634 --> 00:22:05.994
<<RELEASED>>

00:22:21.314 --> 00:22:26.054
I embraced your boasting tight

00:22:26.054 --> 00:22:29.024
Even everything about your sad profile

00:22:29.024 --> 00:22:31.394
I love

00:22:31.394 --> 00:22:35.564
Girl who gets stronger with
every wall she breaks

00:22:35.564 --> 00:22:41.464
My eyes will never wander from you

00:22:41.734 --> 00:22:46.774
Because these too-honest feelings in my heart

00:22:46.774 --> 00:22:50.274
Can't be beaten by anyone

00:22:50.274 --> 00:22:53.414
I absolutely will never let you go

00:22:53.414 --> 00:22:55.584
No matter when or why

00:22:55.584 --> 00:23:00.754
And I'll change that still-unseen last scene

00:23:00.754 --> 00:23:05.094
Devils and angels both have wings

00:23:05.094 --> 00:23:10.734
So let's aim for higher skies

00:23:10.734 --> 00:23:15.434
Don't let your smile be clouded anymore

00:23:15.434 --> 00:23:18.004
When the hopes that connect us now

00:23:18.004 --> 00:23:21.804
Rip the darkness apart

00:23:21.804 --> 00:23:24.744
Together, you and I

00:23:24.974 --> 00:23:30.604
Will fly towards the future, Break Your Destiny

00:23:40.824 --> 00:23:41.894
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.894 --> 00:23:42.754
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.994 --> 00:23:45.864
Today's going to go well. I have a feeling.

00:23:45.864 --> 00:23:47.564
Go well how, exactly?

00:23:47.564 --> 00:23:50.574
Teacher, may I lie down?

00:23:50.574 --> 00:23:51.604
Lie down?

00:23:51.604 --> 00:23:54.304
Relax a little more. There.

00:23:54.444 --> 00:23:56.744
Oh! My heart can't take much more of this!

00:23:56.744 --> 00:23:58.174
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.274 --> 00:24:01.984
Episode 36: "No Boys Allowed!
The Angel's Afternoon"

00:24:01.984 --> 00:24:05.084
Naomi! My Naomi!

00:24:05.084 --> 00:24:06.384
Right, right...

00:24:06.384 --> 00:24:06.914
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.914 --> 00:24:08.384
No Boys Allowed!
The Angel's Afternoon
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.384 --> 00:24:09.874
No Boys Allowed!
The Angel's Afternoon
